      "id": "claim_64238dc574ea450d89a345b5a7134284",
      "statement": "createBrijioMcpServer in servers/mcp/src/mcp-server.ts registers every MCP tool with a Zod input schema and a handler that logs the call, delegates to a tool module for input normalization, serializes the result, and returns it as a discriminated { ok, data | error } union.",
