    {
      "id": "claim_f37b7234fd0b4bd396c2076677d79980",
      "statement": "Tool modules in servers/mcp/src/*-tool.ts and form-action-tools.ts validate/normalize inputs then call helpers in servers/mcp/src/page-actions.ts (or page-context.ts for reads), which build WebSocket request options from a BrijioPageActionsConfig (websocketUrl, pairingToken, timeoutMs, optional approvalTimeoutMs) and send them through the WebSocket client; each request* helper has a default but can be overridden via the config, and the config also carries defaultBrowserInstanceId/defaultTabId fallbacks.",
