      "id": "claim_82d2f2d2646647d4949acb6c90a56e18",
      "statement": "perform_batch supports up to 20 explicit actions (enforced both by the Zod schema actions.min(1).max(20) and MAX_BATCH_ACTIONS=20 in batch-tool.ts), with valid action types click, write_text, set_checked, select_options, submit_form, and upload_file; it reports per-action results/partial failures, supports continueOnError (default false), aborts remaining actions on navigation, and readAfterActions is the only read the batch performs.",
