      "id": "claim_bd2dd38ced2047d9a1613faea21a0eae",
      "statement": "submit_form, fetch_resource, and download_file require client-side in-browser user approval before executing; the approval gate lives in the extension background controller (getApprovalActionType returns the type only for those three operations), not the MCP server, which only assigns actionUUID, sets approvalRequest true, uses the computed approvalTimeoutMs, and surfaces structured approval errors.",
