      "id": "claim_2a61a7f7257645139ecb5d47c97ac4ed",
      "statement": "download_status polls a session-scoped registry and returns a capability of \"full\" or \"not_supported\" (Safari returns \"not_supported\" with an empty items list); download_file initiates a download (chrome.downloads with a downloadId on Chrome/Firefox, fire-and-forget initiated_fire_and_forget with a null downloadId on Safari); fetch_resource fetches a URL with the browser session cookies/auth and streams content back, returning cors_blocked honestly on Safari/cross-origin failures.",
